Trump has explicitly said he doesn't want a ceasefire.

7
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:16,860
Who wants to ceasefire when you are obliterating the other side?

8
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,460
Now that's the cunning part.

9
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,640
A ceasefire, it is a legal promise.

10
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,640
A pause, it's just a tactical reset.

11
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,800
It's the time to reload missiles, find new targets,

12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,420
all while your enemy is distracted.

13
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,840
So, is this a doh, ka?

14
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:31,460
History says yes.

15
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:35,200
Remember FAP28, when the world was thinking diplomacy was happening in Oman,

16
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,740
US and Israel launched their most brutal attack on Iran,

17
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,600
wiping out their entire top leadership.

18
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,960
By giving Iran exactly 120 hours, Trump isn't offering a deal.

19
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,240
He's offering an ultimate.

20
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,380
He's overing his finger over the big red button.

21
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:50,600
Surrender now, or these will be the last five peaceful days that we'll ever see.

22
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,200
So, what do you think?

23
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,380
Is this a must-restro or diplomacy?

24
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:56,700
Or just a calm holding and stop?

25
